s of cash, and face your fears with giant spiders.\n- Gun-Grabbing Action: Win a variety of firearms from the crane and test your aim in a thrilling shooting gallery.\n- No Limits, No Pressure: Enjoy endless crane action without worrying about game overs or grinding for in-game currency.\n\nDive into the chaotic world of Claw Crane Simulator and unleash your inner crane master!\n", "short_description": "Get your hands on smartphones, piles of cash, creepy spiders, and even guns hidden in TNT in this crazy, hands-off crane game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9326460394100015"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "822973337255495"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1234765915015853"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1317776572624762"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1618414695487227"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1618414695487227"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1765821600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "822973337255495"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"lates